In this folder you will find the submission scripts for each of the steps of the pipeline. This helps make the workflow run faster as it submits one job per sample and runs it in parallel.

e.g. 01_seqprep runs the 01_bbsplit_clean_norm.slurm tool on each sample (for sample in $(cut -f1 /your/path/sample.list); do bbsplit_clean_norm.slurm)
